# Impeccable Extract Rules

Extract means turning repeated UI patterns into reusable components.

---

## Core Principle

Do not repeat good work.

Reuse it.

---

## Identify Patterns

- Find repeated UI:
  - cards
  - buttons
  - layouts
  - sections
- Patterns should be consistent

---

## Extract Components

- Create reusable components
- Avoid duplicating UI logic
- Keep components clean and focused

---

## Avoid Duplication

- Do not copy-paste UI
- Use shared components

---

## Generalization

- Generalize enough to reuse
- Do not over-engineer
- Keep API simple

---

## Consistency

- Use extracted components everywhere
- Maintain visual consistency

---

## Scalability

- Extract more as project grows
- Keep system maintainable

---

## Constraints

- Do not change business logic
- Keep components simple
- Maintain readability

---

## Goal

The system should feel:

- reusable
- consistent
- scalable
- clean
